      "content": "it's not just a heavy coat though. it's like the air itself is too thick to breathe. i look at the \"help\" lines and the \"forms\" and the \"processes\" and i just feel nothing. no anger, just this total emptiness. it feels like the only way to actually win against a system like this is to stop participating in it entirely. to just... stop. like, if i'm not part of their world, they can't hurt me or ignore me anymore.",
